	(text "ADF4159 PLL / FMCW RAMP GENERATOR (Task 12)\nAVDD/VP -> +3V3_RX (per Task-11 amendment, folds ADF4159 analog onto Rx rail).\nDVDD/SDVDD -> +1V8_DIG.  REFIN <- Y1 100 MHz TCXO (CWX113-100.0M) via R20 1k + C30 1nF AC-couple.\nCP -> UG-866 Fig.12 passive 3rd-order topology, retuned for Rev C: R21=510, C33=220pF, C34=3.3nF,\nR22=620, C35=47pF, R23=0 -> VTUNE.  See production-package/loop-filter-analysis.json.\nRFinA <- RFIN_DIV (AC-coupled via C37, single-ended per datasheet note); RFinB decoupled 100pF (C36) to GND.\nSPI_SDO is NOT driven from this sheet -- ADF4159 has no DOUT pin; SPI_SDO comes from ADF5904 (Task 14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 10.16 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000009026")
	)
	(text "LEVEL SHIFTING (RESOLVED): ADF4159 CE/CLK/DATA/LE/MUXOUT are 1.8V-domain CMOS (abs max +2.4V,\nadf4159.md Table 4). U7 (SN74AVC4T245PW, TSSOP-16) shifts 3.3V->1.8V: SPI_SCLK/SPI_SDATA/LE_4159/CE_RX\n(A-port, VCCA=+3V3_RX) -> ADF4159 CLK/DATA/LE/CE (B-port, VCCB=+1V8_DIG); 1DIR/2DIR=+3V3_RX (A->B),\n1OE/2OE=GND (enabled). U8 (SN74AVC2T245RSWR, UQFN-10) shifts 1.8V->3.3V: ADF4159 MUXOUT (B1) ->\nRAMP_SYNC (A1); DIR1/DIR2=GND (B->A), OE=GND. Unused U8 ch2: B2 tied GND, A2 no-connect.\n100nF decoupling per supply port (C47-C50). Ports: A=VCCA=3.3V, B=VCCB=1.8V (TI SCES576I/SCES692E).\nSDO: ADF4159 MUXOUT owns RAMP_SYNC only; SPI_SDO readback is ADF5904 DOUT (rx sheet) per INTERFACE.md."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 10.16 150.0 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "1a000000-0000-4000-8000-000000009027")
	)
